flowchart LR
  Clean[Clean dispatcher] --> Events[EventBridge / SNS / SQS]
  Events --> Worker[Retention and notifier Lambda]
  Worker --> Pickup[Private pickup S3: seven-day lifecycle]
  Worker --> Slack[Slack: portal link and file location]
  Slack --> Portal[Existing Transfer web app]
  Identity[IAM Identity Center: assigned groups] --> Portal
  Portal --> Grants[S3 Access Grants: recipient READ prefix]
  Grants --> Pickup
